                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26853168-1034-3f11-8818-572af462e197",
                        "entry_id": "2f434b06-f2be-32e0-bd2c-330308e2a1b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "chinesische Meditations-, Konzentrations- und Bewegungsübungen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b6c1002-925c-4bcd-a4a7-abdf8c81cb58",
                                "sense_id": "26853168-1034-3f11-8818-572af462e197",
                                "text": "„Die Praxis des Qigong soll die Lebensenergie stärken, das Leben verlängern und zu einer gesunden geistigen Verfassung verhelfen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d1452cc9-1d9d-46ba-bf66-3e1c632eed38",
                        "source_entry_id": "2f434b06-f2be-32e0-bd2c-330308e2a1b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "26853168-1034-3f11-8818-572af462e197",
                        "source_sense_description": "chinesische Meditations-, Konzentrations- und Bewegungsübungen",
                        "target_lang_word": "qigong",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "qigong",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e78c3546-0ef9-31e4-b66c-d4bb3649ca30",
                                        "entry_id": "27201964-eaa0-3c5c-a12e-4c076f1b0321",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Chinese system of breathing control, physical exercise and meditation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6816c636-2c8e-4032-be5c-d9b04cfa84b8",
                                                "sense_id": "e78c3546-0ef9-31e4-b66c-d4bb3649ca30",
                                                "text": "Some people may suddenly speak a language and speak it quite fluently. However, it is not a language of human society. What can it be called? It can be called \"cosmic language\" (宇宙語). Actually it is nothing but a language of subtle beings in a space only a little bit higher than ours. Now quite a few of qigong practitioners in China have had such an experience. Some can even speak several such languages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f39abfc4-56f0-4099-be4d-5541b3374aa2",
                                                "sense_id": "e78c3546-0ef9-31e4-b66c-d4bb3649ca30",
                                                "text": "My patients laud qigong as a stressbuster and cure for pesky chronic symptoms that baffle doctors."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab3b4040-d170-4f0f-9d99-c95a0ddbf6ce",
                        "source_entry_id": "2f434b06-f2be-32e0-bd2c-330308e2a1b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "26853168-1034-3f11-8818-572af462e197",
                        "source_sense_description": "chinesische Meditations-, Konzentrations- und Bewegungsübungen",
                        "target_lang_word": "qi gong",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "qi gong",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d1c83c1-3a03-3710-b09e-45ba71e95683",
                                        "entry_id": "792a286e-90bd-3aad-89c8-db05a08b2714",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gymnastique traditionnelle chinoise et méthode de respiration, fondée sur la connaissance et la maîtrise du qi (l’énergie vitale), et associant mouvements lents, exercices respiratoires et concentration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00778e17-709f-473f-9e04-7652280e4b2e",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1c83c1-3a03-3710-b09e-45ba71e95683",
                                                "text": "Concernant plus spécifiquement la médecine chinoise traditionnelle –acupuncture, bien sûr, mais aussi massages à visée thérapeutique ou pratiques psycho-corporelles comme le tai-chi ou le qi gong–, elle est désormais pratiquée dans beaucoup d’hôpitaux et de centres hospitalo-universitaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9227be41-8adc-430d-b1c7-1f7feb03a456",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1c83c1-3a03-3710-b09e-45ba71e95683",
                                                "text": "Le qi gong est composé d’automassages chinois, de mouvements, de marches, d’exercices debout ou assis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3274f820-43b2-4493-bf65-956daf704393",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1c83c1-3a03-3710-b09e-45ba71e95683",
                                                "text": "Le yoga propose également un travail de tonification — proprioception (que l’on retrouve aussi dans le Tai-chi et le Qi gong), des mobilisations douces, des étirements et assouplissements qui contribuent à lever les contractures et blocages musculaires, ainsi que des respirations profondes, amples et lentes qui agissent contre les douleurs dorsales et apaisent les tensions psychiques ou émotionnelles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ab95e7e-0b32-4436-940e-516b3ebcc58b",
                        "source_entry_id": "2f434b06-f2be-32e0-bd2c-330308e2a1b3",
